From: d-b-c-e <anthony.mason1@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 22:26:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 114/124] Add guarded global World distance experiment and
 native counters

---
 src/mame/midway/cruisn/world_distance.h |  57 +++++++++++++
 src/mame/midway/midvunit.cpp            | 101 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/mame/midway/midvunit.h              |   9 +++
